Hey hunters,

Today is a big day! Endless Mode is finally feature-complete. It still lacks polish and might have bugs, so we’d appreciate if you would help us test it and give us your feedback!

Here’s how:
1) Go to your Steam library;
2) Right-click “Relic Hunters Zero” and select “Properties”;
3) Click the “Betas” tab;
4) You will find a field labeled “Enter beta access code to unlock private betas”. Type the following password (without the quotes): “endlesstester”;
5) Click “Check Code”;
6) If you did everything right, you should see this message: “Successfully opted into the ‘endless_test’ content beta.”;
7) Click the drop-down menu labeled “Select the beta you would like to opt into:”, and then select the option “endless_test”;
8) Close the window. The game should update now, and after a few moments you should be good to go!

